@startuml
' Gallery: states with descriptions, a composite state, a choice, the history, and notes
title Washing machine
[*] --> Idle
Idle : door unlocked
state Washing {
  [*] --> Filling
  Filling --> Rinsing : full
  Rinsing --> Spinning : rinsed
  Spinning --> [*]
}
state program <<choice>>
Idle --> program : start
program --> Washing : [door closed]
program --> Idle : [door open]
Washing --> Paused : pause
Paused --> Washing[H] : resume
Washing --> Idle : done
note right of Paused : the door stays locked
@enduml
